---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: 博客
permalink: /blog/
keywords: [个人博客, 博客文章, 技术教程, MC服务器, 内网穿透, CDN, 云服务器, 技术分享, MC, 服务器, 我的世界, Minecraft, 虚拟机, 星辰曦羽]
description: "本站所有博客文章的列表"
---

<section class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 py-10">
  <h1 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-6">全部文章</h1>
  <div class="grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-3">
    {% for post in collections.posts %}
    <a href="{{ post.url | url }}" class="block p-5 rounded-2xl border border-black/5 dark:border-white/10 hover:border-livingCoral transition" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="{{ loop.index0 % 6 * 60 }}">
      {% if post.data.cover %}
      <div class="h-40 w-full rounded-xl overflow-hidden mb-3">
        {% image post.data.cover, post.data.title, "(min-width: 768px) 320px, 100vw", "eager", "", "w-full h-full object-cover" %}
      </div>
      {% endif %}
      <p class="text-sm text-neutral-500 dark:text-neutral-400">{{ post.date | readableDate }}</p>
      <p class="mt-1 font-semibold">{{ post.data.title }}</p>
      <div class="mt-2 flex flex-wrap gap-2 text-sm">
        {% if post.data.category %}
        <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-livingCoral/10 text-livingCoral">{{ post.data.category }}</span>
        {% endif %}
        {% for tag in post.data.tags %}
        <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-black/5 dark:bg-white/10">#{{ tag }}</span>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
      <p class="mt-2 text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-400">{{ post.data.description }}</p>
    </a>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>


